This isn't just another ancient Eastern tradition that is mostly ignored by modern society.

00:07:37.420 --> 00:07:44.100
Wabi-sabi is deeply ingrained within modern Japanese culture. It's even taught in schools,

00:07:44.380 --> 00:07:48.600
Writer Leonard Koren wrote that wabi-sabi is

00:08:04.550 --> 00:08:08.500
Wabi-sabi is loving that mole on your partner's cheek.

